  message: "P3 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 100b6fbb6e; owner-requested re-check of open P3 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p3_review_11012026/iobcat1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Review 2026-11-01 on 100b6fbb6e: java repro still gives java:java.nio.file.Files:0-0:readAllBytes (hint MyFiles); slot code now java.py:3473. Kotlin and scala untyped locals (val Files = makeIt()) now live-verified: both emit module java.nio.file.Files; a constructor-typed kotlin local routes to external correctly. The discussion's kotlin case (val out = Sink(); out.println) still binds to object out's method (kotlin.py:2215). MECHANISM: file-scoped import/class map consulted before the local binder so a shadowing local takes an imported type's identity. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-hilam,WI-bahup."  # 0b3f
